  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味が　強い　食材。焦げる寸前まで　じっくり　焼いているので香ばしさと　うま味が　たっぷりだぞ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛이 강한 식재료. 타기 직전까지 바짝 구워서 고소함과 감칠맛으로 가득하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味強勁的食材。充分煎得要焦而不焦，使香味和鮮味相當飽滿。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé. Cuit jusqu’à caramélisation, sa saveur déborde d’umami et de parfums alléchants.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese sehr salzige Zutat besitzt ein intensives Aroma und vollmundigen Geschmack, da sie schön kross angebraten wurde.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiene un sabor salado bastante fuerte, pero, si se cocina hasta estar casi quemada, se vuelve intensa y aromática.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto salato. Cotta quasi fino ad abbrustolirla, è fragrante e molto saporita.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This very salty ingredient has been cooked just shy of charred, making it burst with fragrance and tasty flavor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "塩味が　強い　食材。焦げる寸前まで　じっくり　焼いているので香ばしさと　うま味が　たっぷりだぞ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
